DTEND:20261024T225500Z
DTSTAMP:20261024T210000Z
UID:yx4n4o7Ggs
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nThe Seattle Polish Film Festival
  presents the film Brother. When her husband ends up in prison\, Agnieszka
  takes up the fight for her family's security\, her beloved sons' dreams\,
  and also for true love\, which unexpectedly appears in her life.\n\nhttps
 ://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/seattle-polish-film-festival-2026/broth
 er\n\nEstimated start: 14:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
